cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use SMAIRT in your research, please cite it.
title: "SMAIRT: Scientific Method with AI Research Toolkit"
abstract: >-
  SMAIRT creates and manages readable, file-based scientific research workspaces
  that keep a traceable record. Every reported result links back to the hypothesis
  it tested, the script that produced it, and the raw log it came from.
type: software
authors:
  - name: PNNL Computational Biology
    website: https://github.com/PNNL-CompBio
repository-code: https://github.com/PNNL-CompBio/smairt-template
license: MIT
version: 0.5.0
keywords:
  - reproducible research
  - scientific workflow
  - research provenance
  - AI-assisted research
  - hypothesis-driven research
